# Open screenshots in Finder

Whenever this session writes, captures, or updates screenshots (PNG/JPEG/WebP stills, including portfolio capture artifacts), immediately open them in Finder with macOS `open`.

- Prefer `open -R` on the files so Finder reveals the actual images.
- If there are several stills in one folder, also `open` the folder.
- Do this as soon as the files exist. Do not wait to be asked.
- Do not substitute Preview-only or in-chat thumbnails for this step.
